    <string name="help_body">Today — what to take now, grouped by time: after waking, during the day, dinner, before bed. Tap a supplement to tick it as taken (tap again to untick). Long-press to open it.\n\nDay check-in — a few taps: the day type (shift or day off) and 1–5 for each question. Questions can be changed in Settings.\n\nCabinet — all supplements with stock, a “lasts until” forecast and monthly cost. Alternation groups show whose turn it is now and who is next.\n\nLeave unknowns empty: mg, stock, price. Then there is simply no forecast or cost instead of wrong numbers. For a pack you already started, enter “days already taken” — the cycle continues from the right day.\n\nStats — adherence, average ratings, costs and a calendar (tap a day to add what you forgot). A supplement’s page compares ratings on days with and without it.\n\nSchema (JSON) — a ready list of supplements can be pasted from the clipboard (“⋯” → “Paste schema from clipboard”) or opened from a file. The backup from Settings is the same format plus all history.</string>
